[b]License[/b]: Heart of Magic Librarian's own source files are MIT. The plugin DLLs statically link CommonLibSSE-NG (GPL-3.0-or-later with the Modding Exception and the GPL-3.0 Linking Exception), so the DLLs are a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work; [i]THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md[/i] and the [i]licenses[/i] folder in the download have the details, the other libraries' licenses and where the complete source is. Some parts come from others and keep their own licenses (listed in [i]THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md[/i]): the tome hook based on Don't Eat Spell Tomes (MIT), math code from fdlibm / V8, the fonts (SIL OFL), and the optional ISL patch script, which belongs to its original authors (Hackfield, with Sit Down and Read code by GiraPomba), is not under this project's MIT license and is released as a modified patch as their Nexus permissions allow, with credit. As the GPL requires, the permissions on this page allow modifying and redistributing the DLLs under those terms.
